{% from "icons.njk" import icon %}
{% from "macros.njk" import book %}
{% include "hero.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">More than a yacht</span>
      <h2>Your floating basecamp in the Salish Sea</h2>
      <p class="lead">Supernova is built for people who want to do things out here, not just look at them.</p>
      <p>Spend the day diving cold, clear water full of life, paddling quiet coves, hiking old growth forest or riding island singletrack. Then come back to a hot shower in your own stateroom and a Northwest dinner at anchor.</p>
      <p>Every trip is run by Captain Paul, a USCG 100 ton Master Captain, and planned around what your group wants to do.</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/expeditions/">Explore the expeditions</a></p>
    </div>
    {% img "stern-toys-at-anchor.webp", "Supernova at anchor with paddleboards, a kayak and the landing craft tied up at the stern", "(max-width:860px) 100vw, 560px" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-forest glance" style="padding:64px 0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="center">Supernova at a glance</h2>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><div class="icon">{{ icon('boat') }}</div><strong>78 ft</strong><span>Expedition yacht</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="icon">{{ icon('shower') }}</div><strong>4</strong><span>Private staterooms with showers</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="icon">{{ icon('guests') }}</div><strong>Up to 6</strong><span>Guests per trip</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="icon">{{ icon('landing') }}</div><strong>21 ft</strong><span>Landing craft</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="center" style="margin:36px 0 0"><a class="text-link" href="/the-boat/">Tour the boat</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="expeditions" style="scroll-margin-top:100px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="intro center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Three ways to explore</span>
      <h2>Choose your expedition</h2>
      <p>Multi day trips only. Pick a scheduled expedition or charter the whole boat for your own group.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <a class="card" href="/scuba-diving-expeditions/">
        {% img "pnw-scuba-reef.webp", "Lingcod resting among pink and orange anemones on a Pacific Northwest reef", "(max-width:640px) 100vw, 380px" %}
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="meta">3 to 7 days · per stateroom</span>
          <h3>Scuba Diving Expeditions</h3>
          <p>Cold water, big life. The yacht is basecamp and our landing craft runs as a live boat into tight dive spots few divers ever reach.</p>
          <span class="more">Learn more</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/private-charters/">
        {% img "old-growth-cedar.webp", "Family standing at the base of a giant old growth cedar on a Pacific Northwest island", "(max-width:640px) 100vw, 380px" %}
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="meta">Whole boat · built around you</span>
          <h3>Private Charters</h3>
          <p>Paddleboard, hike old growth forest, explore the islands and eat well. We help you design the trip around the things you want to do.</p>
          <span class="more">Learn more</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/mountain-bike-expeditions/">
        {% img "riders-landing-craft-beach.webp", "Mountain bikers stepping off the landing craft onto a pebble beach", "(max-width:640px) 100vw, 380px" %}
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="meta">5 days · 4 nights · small group</span>
          <h3>Mountain Bike Expeditions</h3>
          <p>Ride a different island trail system every day. The landing craft puts riders and bikes on shore, and the yacht is your lodge at night.</p>
          <span class="more">Learn more</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="center" style="display:flex;justify-content:center">{{ book(site) }}</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-sand">
  <div class="wrap split rev">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2>The yacht is basecamp. The landing craft gets you in.</h2>
      <p>Most boats stop where the dock ends. We tow a rugged 21 foot aluminum landing craft with a front loading bow gate, so we can put divers, riders, bikes and hikers right on the beach.</p>
      <p>That means dive sites, trailheads and coves you can't reach any other way, and no ferry schedules or hotel check ins.</p>
    </div>
    {% img "family-waterfall-landing-craft.webp", "Family on the landing craft's bow ramp in front of a waterfall", "(max-width:860px) 100vw, 560px" %}
  </div>
  <div class="wrap features">
    <div class="feature"><div class="icon">{{ icon('shower') }}</div><h3>Hot showers in every stateroom</h3><p>Four private staterooms, each with its own bathroom and shower.</p></div>
    <div class="feature"><div class="icon">{{ icon('chef') }}</div><h3>Northwest cuisine aboard</h3><p>Chef prepared meals with local seafood and seasonal ingredients on crewed trips.</p></div>
    <div class="feature"><div class="icon">{{ icon('dive') }}</div><h3>Onboard dive compressor</h3><p>Fill tanks on the boat between dives. No trips back to town.</p></div>
    <div class="feature"><div class="icon">{{ icon('wifi') }}</div><h3>Comfort off the grid</h3><p>Water maker, solar, quiet generators and Starlink Wi-Fi throughout.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">See it for yourself</span>
      <h2>Life aboard Supernova</h2>
      <p>Highlights from culinary voyages, private charters and scuba diving expeditions around the San Juan Islands.</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/gallery/">View the gallery</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="video" data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1178268833?autoplay=1&title=0&byline=0&portrait=0" data-title="Supernova Expeditions trip compilation">
      {% img "kayak-view-supernova.webp", "View from a kayak of Supernova anchored on glassy water", "(max-width:860px) 100vw, 560px" %}
      <button class="play" aria-label="Play the Supernova trip video"></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-sand">
  <div class="wrap split">
    {% img "captain-paul.webp", "Captain Paul smiling on the deck of Supernova", "(max-width:860px) 100vw, 560px", "lazy", "tall" %}
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Your captain</span>
      <h2>Meet Captain Paul</h2>
      <p>Captain Paul is a USCG 100 ton Master Captain, scuba diver and commercial pilot who has logged thousands of nautical miles through the Pacific Northwest and Canada.</p>
      <p>He's usually joined by his wife Nova, the first mate and cook who inspired the boat's name. Their goal is simple: get you out into the wild parts of this coast and bring you home happy.</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/about-us/">More about Captain Paul</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap split rev">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">One clear price</span>
      <h2>What's included on scheduled expeditions</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Captain, mate and private chef</li>
        <li>Chef prepared meals and beverages</li>
        <li>Private stateroom with ensuite bathroom and shower</li>
        <li>Paddleboards, kayaks and a 15 foot tender</li>
        <li>Fuel, cleaning and damage deposit coverage</li>
        <li>Landing craft and divemaster on scuba expeditions</li>
      </ul>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/pricing/">See pricing and terms</a></p>
      {{ book(site) }}
    </div>
    {% img "guests-dinner-table.webp", "Guests sharing a meal around the table in Supernova's enclosed flybridge", "(max-width:860px) 100vw, 560px" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-sand" style="padding:64px 0">
  <div class="wrap intro center">
    <span class="eyebrow">Guest reviews</span>
    <h2>What our guests say</h2>
    <p>Our first season of guest reviews is on the way. Been out with us? We'd love to hear about your trip.</p>
    <p><a class="text-link" href="{{ site.social[0].url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Share your trip with us</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="intro">
      <span class="eyebrow">From the trips</span>
      <h2>Out here, every day looks different</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="mosaic">
      <figure class="w2 h2">{% img "bow-sunset-silhouettes.webp", "Two guests on Supernova's bow at sunset", "(max-width:760px) 100vw, 600px" %}</figure>
      <figure>{% img "kids-crab-pot.webp", "Kids grinning over a crab pot full of Dungeness crab at sunset", "(max-width:760px) 50vw, 300px" %}</figure>
      <figure>{% img "guests-swimming-cove.webp", "Guests swimming in a clear green cove off Supernova's stern", "(max-width:760px) 50vw, 300px" %}</figure>
      <figure>{% img "beach-campfire-sucia.webp", "Families around a beach campfire at sunset on Sucia Island", "(max-width:760px) 50vw, 300px" %}</figure>
      <figure>{% img "humpback-whale-tail.webp", "Humpback whale tail lifting out of the water", "(max-width:760px) 50vw, 300px" %}</figure>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:24px"><a href="/gallery/">See the full gallery →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-sand">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Departure</span>
      <h2>Trips start and end in Anacortes</h2>
      <p>Anacortes is the gateway to the San Juan Islands, about 90 minutes north of Seattle. Alternative pickup and drop off locations are available for an added fuel charge.</p>
      <p>From here we can cruise the San Juans, cross into British Columbia's Gulf Islands and run as far as Desolation Sound on longer charters.</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Departure point and directions</a></p>
    </div>
    {% img "anchorage-landing-craft.webp", "Landing craft and paddleboards on a rocky island beach with Supernova anchored in the bay behind", "(max-width:860px) 100vw, 560px" %}
  </div>
</section>

